{"3721020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Galactic Bounty", "steam_appid": 3721020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4755540], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Take the Contract. Get Paid.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>droid bounty hunter for hire</strong>. Accept contracts, deploy into dangerous locations, eliminate targets, break into secure systems, and get paid. Spend your rewards on <strong>weapons, hacking tools, and upgrades for your droid</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/44262ba86b3dcf354485a38ef9a00a4c.poster.avif?t=1788094291\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/44262ba86b3dcf354485a38ef9a00a4c.webm?t=1788094291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/44262ba86b3dcf354485a38ef9a00a4c.mp4?t=1788094291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Accept the Job</u></strong><br>Browse the contract roster and deploy with a <strong>clear objective</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounty:</strong> track and eliminate a high-value target.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction:</strong> infiltrate secured areas and extract the target alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destruction:</strong> plant explosives in enemy strongholds and escape before detonation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Data Breach:</strong> hack terminals, bypass security, and steal intel for your client.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repossession:</strong> infiltrate the site, take the asset, and deliver it to the buyer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protection:</strong> defend the asset under enemy pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Blast, Breach, Hack, and Fight</u></strong><br>Bypass local security with force,  push through resistance with <strong>black-market firearms, grenades, and droid abilities</strong>. Every contract is about getting in, handling the objective, and returning to your ship with a big payout.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/f5d03ebab80233e69d0e57906aa1f97d.poster.avif?t=1788094291\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/f5d03ebab80233e69d0e57906aa1f97d.webm?t=1788094291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/f5d03ebab80233e69d0e57906aa1f97d.mp4?t=1788094291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Get Paid. Upgrade Your Droid.</strong></u><br>Cash-in completed contracts for <i>Crypts</i>, <i>Data</i>, and <i>Reputation</i>. Spend your earnings at the <i>Crypt</i> <i>Market</i> to unlock restricted firearms, gear, and upgrades. Earn <i>Data</i> and <i>Software Upgrades</i> to improve your droid’s combat and utility systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Failure Has a Cost</strong></u><br>A bad job has consequences. If your current droid model is destroyed, the replacement cost comes out of your pocket. Abort the mission and take the hit, or push deeper for the  payout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/897fb8c7a5c634831f2bfa5528ff8929.poster.avif?t=1788094291